# Line ending policy:
# - Text files are stored as LF in the repository.
# - *.sh, *.js and other cross-platform text keep LF in the working tree
#   even on Windows (avoids LF<->CRLF noise and silent mismatches).
# - Windows-only batch files keep CRLF in the working tree.

*.sh text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.cjs text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.map text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf

*.bat text eol=crlf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.asar binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
